    "description": "<p><strong>FIRE DRAGON</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Size</strong> Small</p>\n<p><strong>Level</strong> 6 (<strong>EL</strong> 5); <strong>DC</strong> 20</p>\n<p><strong>Initiative</strong> +20</p>\n<p><strong>Speed</strong> 30 feet; Fly 80</p>\n<p><strong>Senses</strong> Darkvision 55’, Nightvision 110’, Scent 30’</p>\n<p><strong>Languages</strong> Low Tongue, Wyrmish</p>\n<p><strong>ABILITY SCORES</strong> <strong>STR</strong> +3, <strong>CON</strong> +2, <strong>DEX</strong> +3, <strong>INT</strong> +0, <strong>WIS</strong> +1, <strong>CHA</strong> +2</p>\n<p><strong>SKILLS</strong> Acrobatics +10(4), Arcana +9(6), Athletics +10(4), Climbing +10(4), Culture +9(6), Deception +9(4), Diplomacy +9(4), Intimidate +9(4), Meditation +8(4), Mental Focus +8(4), Nature +8(4), Perception +8(4), Power Manipulation +9(6), Sense Motive +8(4), Survival +8(4)</p>\n<p><strong>DEFENCE</strong><br>DB +23 (Base +16; Other +3; Stat +3; Status +1); DR 6<br>Fort +15, Ref +14, Will +14<br>HP 104; Immunity fire, paralysis, sleep; Weakness cold</p>\n<p><strong>FEATS/SPECIAL</strong> Alertness, Great Fortitude, Iron Will, Smokevision</p>\n<p><strong>Fire Dragon Breath</strong> 2 AP (arcane, fire, focus, invocation, save)<br>The dragon breathes a 15-foot cone that inflicts 6d8 fire damage. The breath weapon has the focus trait, and any targets may make a basic Reflex save to avoid damage.</p>\n<p><strong>ATTACKS</strong><br>Bite +12 (finesse) 2d6+3 piercing plus 1d6 fire<br>Claw +12 (agile, finesse, versatile - p) 2d5+3 slashing</p>\n<p><strong>MAGIC</strong><br>A fire dragon is a High Magic caster.<br>CL 3; Spellcraft +8; PP 26<br>Spells 4 x Cantrip, 5 additional spells (max PP 4).</p>\n<p><strong>SPECIAL ABILITIES BY LEVEL</strong> 8: Draconic Assault; 10: Wing Buffet; 12: Frightful Aura; 14: Draconic Shifting; 16: Fiery Blood; 18: Fiery Aura; 20: Scorching Breath; 22: Spell Resilience</p>\n<p><em>A fire dragon is a fearsome, flame-breathing creature, typically adorned with fiery scales and possessing the ability to unleash destructive torrents of fire.</em></p>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> hatched by Dragon Tamer at level 6, with the skill ranks printed (B10-7), the feats printed (each counting as a pick made), its languages, immunities and weakness. The breath is 6d8 at 6 and a die a level after (C5), a Focus ability with a basic Reflex save at the creature DC; it grows as a cone with the table. Its specials arrive by its own level from the system's Creature Codex. Its DB is the printed block's (Graham, 28 October 2026): the system's creature rule, half its level as an other bonus and its class bonus − 2 as a status bonus. Its natural attacks follow the system's one size ladder (B10-10).</p>",
